  "html": "<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"시스템-챗봇-둘러보기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#시스템-챗봇-둘러보기\" class=\"peer\">시스템 챗봇 둘러보기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><strong>시스템</strong> 탭에서는 현재 사용할 수 있는 시스템 챗봇을 확인하고 대화를 시작할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"시스템-챗봇-찾기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#시스템-챗봇-찾기\" class=\"peer\">시스템 챗봇 찾기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>챗봇 허브에서 <strong>챗봇 둘러보기</strong>를 선택하세요.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>상단의 <strong>시스템</strong> 탭을 선택하세요.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>필요한 경우 <strong>이름 검색</strong> 입력란에 챗봇 이름을 입력하세요.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>카드를 선택해 상세 정보를 확인하거나 <strong>채팅 시작</strong>을 선택해 대화를 시작하세요.</p></div></div>\n<p>시스템 챗봇 카드에는 <strong>시스템</strong> 표시가 붙습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>별표를 선택하면 해당 챗봇을 즐겨찾기에 추가하거나 즐겨찾기에서 해제할 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"개인-챗봇-둘러보기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#개인-챗봇-둘러보기\" class=\"peer\">개인 챗봇 둘러보기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><strong>개인</strong> 탭에서는 내가 만들어 배포한 개인 챗봇을 확인하고 대화를 시작할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"개인-챗봇-찾기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#개인-챗봇-찾기\" class=\"peer\">개인 챗봇 찾기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<div class=\"fd-steps\"><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>챗봇 허브에서 <strong>챗봇 둘러보기</strong>를 선택하세요.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>상단의 <strong>개인</strong> 탭을 선택하세요.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>필요한 경우 <strong>이름 검색</strong> 입력란에 챗봇 이름을 입력하세요.</p></div><div class=\"fd-step\"><p>카드를 선택해 상세 정보를 확인하거나 <strong>채팅 시작</strong>을 선택해 대화를 시작하세요.</p></div></div>\n<p>개인 챗봇 카드에는 정보가 있는 경우 그룹, 워크스페이스, 워크플로우가 표시됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>개인 챗봇은 배포한 뒤 챗봇 허브를 조회하면 목록에 등록됩니다. 별도의 추가 버튼은 제공되지 않습니다.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>별표를 선택하면 해당 챗봇을 즐겨찾기에 추가하거나 즐겨찾기에서 해제할 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></div>"
}